    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457390/extras/e9b30ed33d4567f9b4e15260208f2f19.poster.avif?t=1752438459\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457390/extras/e9b30ed33d4567f9b4e15260208f2f19.webm?t=1752438459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457390/extras/e9b30ed33d4567f9b4e15260208f2f19.mp4?t=1752438459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Little Wings Deliveries</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a short, playful adventure in your cozy flying boat and sail through fluffy clouds. Discover floating islands and befriend their quirky citizens. Jump, roll, climb, and skate through Cloudburg as Skye faces her biggest obstacle on her way to the Royal Postal Academy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Little Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f0 Around 30 minutes to 1 hour of playtime!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2601\ufe0f Sail through the clouds with your flying boat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f Explore 5 different tiny flying islands!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd2a Meet a small cast of quirky characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf92 Collect cool items like a skateboard, selfie stick, and more!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a0\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Attention: This game is digestible\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\ude0b\ud83c\udf74</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We're <strong>TENSTACK!</strong> A small collective of game makers creating lots of creative and 'digestible' games. A digestible game respects its players' money and time, is designed around a single idea, and doesn\u2019t overstay its welcome. We want you to be able to finish our games in just a couple of sessions\u2014without ever making you feel stuffed, so to say.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457390/extras/e9b30ed33d4567f9b4e15260208f2f19.poster.avif?t=1752438459\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457390/extras/e9b30ed33d4567f9b4e15260208f2f19.webm?t=1752438459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457390/extras/e9b30ed33d4567f9b4e15260208f2f19.mp4?t=1752438459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Little Wings Deliveries</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a short, playful adventure in your cozy flying boat and sail through fluffy clouds. Discover floating islands and befriend their quirky citizens. Jump, roll, climb, and skate through Cloudburg as Skye faces her biggest obstacle on her way to the Royal Postal Academy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Little Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f0 Around 30 minutes to 1 hour of playtime!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2601\ufe0f Sail through the clouds with your flying boat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f Explore 5 different tiny flying islands!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd2a Meet a small cast of quirky characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf92 Collect cool items like a skateboard, selfie stick, and more!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a0\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Attention: This game is digestible\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\ude0b\ud83c\udf74</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We're <strong>TENSTACK!</strong> A small collective of game makers creating lots of creative and 'digestible' games. A digestible game respects its players' money and time, is designed around a single idea, and doesn\u2019t overstay its welcome. We want you to be able to finish our games in just a couple of sessions\u2014without ever making you feel stuffed, so to say.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Embark on a short, playful adventure in your cozy flying boat and sail through fluffy clouds. Discover floating islands and befriend their quirky citizens. Jump, roll, climb, and skate through Cloudburg as Skye faces her biggest obstacle on her way to the Royal Postal Academy!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cI could berate this pigeon for building a wooden sky raft instead of using her perfectly good wings, but this is the kind of avian innovation we should be praising. The more calories the pigeons save, the less disastrous chippy assaults. Nicely done, Skye.\u201d<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br>",
